WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.740
Have you heard of the invisible thread theory?

2
00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:03.400
It says that we're connected with some people

3
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.140
long before we even find out they exist.

4
00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.900
Maybe the person who will one day become the most important to you

5
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.380
is sitting right now in some café

6
00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:11.900
where you've never even been.

7
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.800
Maybe your future best friend

8
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.100
lives today in some other country.

9
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.640
Maybe the love of your life, as they say here,

10
00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:20.280
you've already met once, and you passed each other on the street,

11
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.340
and you didn't even notice her.

12
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:22.760
And, as this story says,

13
00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:25.100
maybe one seemingly ordinary decision of yours —

14
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:28.060
say, to go somewhere, to go out there,

15
00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:29.480
to travel somewhere —

16
00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:32.200
will tie this thread, will connect you.

17
00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:35.900
Let's not think that we've already seen everything in life,

18
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:38.840
that this is everything — from people and from everything else.

19
00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:42.600
Maybe the most beautiful stories are waiting for you

20
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.220
with people you don't even know yet.